@startuml 使用案例7_1_1_帳號驗證
title 使用案例7.1.1: 帳號驗證流程 (Email 驗證碼)

actor "新註冊使用者" as NewUser
participant "VerifyRegistration.vue" as VerifyPage
participant "client.ts" as APIClient
participant "auth.py(blueprint)" as AuthBlueprint
participant "auth_service.py" as AuthService
participant "email_service.py" as EmailService
participant "audit_service.py" as AuditService
participant "pending_registration.py(model)" as PendingModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 註冊完成後導向驗證頁面 ==
note over NewUser
  前提條件:
  - 使用者剛完成 7.1 註冊流程
  - 已收到驗證碼郵件
  - URL 帶有 pending_id, masked_email, role
end note

NewUser -> VerifyPage: 被導向至\n/verify-registration?pending_id=xxx&masked=a***@example.com&role=GENERAL_MEMBER
activate VerifyPage
VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: 取得 route.query 參數\npendingId, maskedEmail, roleFromQuery
VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: 顯示驗證表單\n+ 遮蔽後的 Email
note right
  顯示內容:
  - "已將驗證碼寄至：a***@example.com"
  - 6 位數驗證碼輸入框
  - "驗證" 按鈕
  - "重新發送驗證碼" 連結
end note
VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示驗證頁面
deactivate VerifyPage

== 2. 查看 Email 驗證碼 ==
NewUser -> NewUser: 開啟 Email 信箱\n查看註冊驗證碼
note left
  Email 內容 (from 7.1):
  主旨: "[App] 註冊驗證碼"
  內容: "您的註冊驗證碼為： 123456
  此驗證碼於 15 分鐘後失效。
  如非您本人操作，請忽略本信。"
end note

== 3. 輸入驗證碼 ==
NewUser -> VerifyPage: 輸入驗證碼 (6位數字)
activate VerifyPage
VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: v-model="code"\n更新 code 值
VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示輸入內容
deactivate VerifyPage

== 4. 提交驗證碼 ==
NewUser -> VerifyPage: 點擊「驗證」按鈕
activate VerifyPage
VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: submitCode()\n@submit.prevent
VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: 檢查 pendingId 和 code\n是否存在

alt pendingId 或 code 為空
    VerifyPage --> NewUser: 不執行任何動作
    note left: 欄位未填寫完整
else 欄位齊全
    VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: loading = true
    VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: 組裝 payload\n{ pending_id, code, role }
end

== 5. 呼叫驗證 API ==
VerifyPage -> APIClient: api.post('/auth/verify-registration', payload)
activate APIClient
APIClient -> APIClient: 添加 baseURL
APIClient -> AuthBlueprint: POST /auth/verify-registration\nBody: { pending_id, code, role }
activate AuthBlueprint

== 6. 後端驗證欄位 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: data = request.get_json()
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 檢查必填欄位\n(pending_id, code)

alt 缺少必填欄位
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 400 Bad Request\n{"message": "pending_id 和 code 為必填"}
    APIClient --> VerifyPage: error (400)
    VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: message = "驗證失敗"\nmessageClass = 'bg-red-50'
    VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示錯誤訊息\n(紅色提示框)
    note left: 中斷流程
else 欄位齊全
    AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 取得 pending_id, code, role
end

== 7. 查詢待註冊記錄 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthService: verify_registration(\npending_id, code, role)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> PendingModel: db.session.get(\nPendingRegistration, pending_id)
activate PendingModel
PendingModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM pending_registrations\nWHERE pending_id=:id\nLIMIT 1
activate DB
DB --> PendingModel: PendingRegistration 或 None
deactivate DB
PendingModel --> AuthService: pending
deactivate PendingModel

alt 找不到待註冊記錄
    AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise NotFoundError\n("找不到對應的驗證流程")
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 404 Not Found\n{"message": "找不到對應的驗證流程"}
    APIClient --> VerifyPage: error (404)
    VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: message = "驗證失敗"
    VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示錯誤訊息
    note left: 中斷流程
else 找到待註冊記錄
    AuthService -> AuthService: 取得 pending 物件
end

== 8. 檢查驗證碼是否過期 ==
AuthService -> AuthService: 比較 pending.code_expires_at\n與 datetime.utcnow()
note right
  驗證碼有效期: 15 分鐘
  從 register_pending() 建立時開始計算
end note

alt 驗證碼已過期
    AuthService -> PendingModel: db.session.delete(pending)
    activate PendingModel
    PendingModel -> DB: DELETE FROM pending_registrations\nWHERE pending_id=:id
    activate DB
    DB --> PendingModel: 刪除成功
    deactivate DB
    deactivate PendingModel
    
    AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()
    activate DB
    DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
    deactivate DB
    
    AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise ValidationError\n("驗證碼已過期，請重新註冊或重新發送")
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 400 Bad Request\n{"message": "驗證碼已過期..."}
    APIClient --> VerifyPage: error (400)
    VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: message = "驗證碼已過期..."
    VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示過期錯誤訊息
    note left: 中斷流程，建議重新註冊
else 驗證碼未過期
    AuthService -> AuthService: 繼續驗證流程
end

== 9. 驗證驗證碼正確性 ==
AuthService -> AuthService: verify_verification_code(\ncode, pending.verification_code_hash)
note right
  使用雜湊比對:
  將輸入的 code 雜湊後
  與資料庫的 code_hash 比對
end note

alt 驗證碼錯誤
    AuthService -> AuthService: pending.attempts += 1
    AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()\n更新嘗試次數
    activate DB
    DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
    deactivate DB
    
    alt 嘗試次數 >= 5
        AuthService -> PendingModel: db.session.delete(pending)
        activate PendingModel
        PendingModel -> DB: DELETE FROM pending_registrations
        activate DB
        DB --> PendingModel: 刪除成功
        deactivate DB
        deactivate PendingModel
        
        AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()
        activate DB
        DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
        deactivate DB
        
        AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise ValidationError\n("驗證失敗次數過多，請重新註冊")
        AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 400 Bad Request\n{"message": "驗證失敗次數過多..."}
        APIClient --> VerifyPage: error (400)
        VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示錯誤：嘗試次數過多
        note left: 中斷流程
    else 嘗試次數 < 5
        AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise ValidationError\n("驗證碼錯誤")
        AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 400 Bad Request\n{"message": "驗證碼錯誤"}
        APIClient --> VerifyPage: error (400)
        VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: message = "驗證碼錯誤"
        VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示錯誤：請重新輸入
        note left: 可繼續嘗試
    end
else 驗證碼正確
    AuthService -> AuthService: 驗證通過，準備建立用戶
end

== 10. 再次檢查 Email 是否已註冊 ==
AuthService -> UserModel: User.query.filter_by(email=pending.email).first()
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE email=:email\nLIMIT 1
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: User 或 None
deactivate DB
UserModel --> AuthService: existing_user
deactivate UserModel

alt Email 已被其他人註冊
    AuthService -> PendingModel: db.session.delete(pending)
    activate PendingModel
    PendingModel -> DB: DELETE FROM pending_registrations
    activate DB
    DB --> PendingModel: 刪除成功
    deactivate DB
    deactivate PendingModel
    
    AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()
    activate DB
    DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
    deactivate DB
    
    AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise ConflictError\n("此 email 已被註冊")
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 409 Conflict\n{"message": "此 email 已被註冊"}
    APIClient --> VerifyPage: error (409)
    VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示衝突錯誤
    note left: 中斷流程
else Email 未被註冊
    AuthService -> AuthService: 繼續建立用戶
end

== 11. 確定用戶角色 ==
AuthService -> AuthService: role_to_set = UserRole.GENERAL_MEMBER\n(預設值)

alt role 參數有值
    AuthService -> AuthService: try:\n  role_to_set = UserRole(role)\nexcept ValueError:\n  使用預設值
    note right
      支援的角色:
      - GENERAL_MEMBER (個人)
      - SHELTER_MEMBER (收容所)
      - ADMIN (管理員)
    end note
end

== 12. 建立正式用戶帳號 ==
AuthService -> UserModel: user = User(\nemail, password_hash, username,\nphone_number, region, address,\nrole, verified=True)
activate UserModel
note right
  從 PendingRegistration 複製資料:
  - email
  - password_hash (已雜湊)
  - username
  - phone_number
  - region
  - address
  - role (確定後的角色)
  - verified=True (已驗證)
end note

UserModel -> DB: INSERT INTO users\nVALUES (...)
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: user_id (auto_increment)
deactivate DB
UserModel --> AuthService: user 物件
deactivate UserModel

== 13. 刪除待註冊記錄 ==
AuthService -> PendingModel: db.session.delete(pending)
activate PendingModel
PendingModel -> DB: DELETE FROM pending_registrations\nWHERE pending_id=:id
activate DB
DB --> PendingModel: 刪除成功
deactivate DB
deactivate PendingModel

AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()\n提交兩筆變更 (新增 User + 刪除 Pending)
activate DB
DB --> AuthService: 交易成功
deactivate DB

note right
  原子性操作:
  1. INSERT users
  2. DELETE pending_registrations
  一起提交，確保資料一致性
end note

== 14. 記錄審計日誌 ==
AuthService -> AuditService: audit_service.log(\naction='user.register',\nactor_id=user.user_id,\ntarget_type='user',\ntarget_id=user.user_id,\nbefore_state=None,\nafter_state={'email': user.email})
activate AuditService
AuditService -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs\nVALUES (...)
activate DB
DB --> AuditService: 記錄成功
deactivate DB
AuditService --> AuthService: 審計完成
deactivate AuditService

AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: return user
deactivate AuthService

== 15. 回傳驗證成功 ==
AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 200 OK\n{\n  "message": "驗證成功，帳號已建立"\n}
deactivate AuthBlueprint
APIClient --> VerifyPage: response.data
deactivate APIClient

== 16. 顯示成功訊息並導向登入 ==
VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: message = '驗證成功，請使用您的帳號登入'\nmessageClass = 'bg-green-50'
VerifyPage --> NewUser: 顯示成功訊息\n(綠色提示框)
deactivate VerifyPage

NewUser -> NewUser: 看到成功訊息

VerifyPage -> VerifyPage: setTimeout(() => {\n  router.push('/login')\n}, 2000)
note right
  2 秒後自動導向登入頁面
end note

VerifyPage --> NewUser: 2 秒後自動導向至\n/login 登入頁面
NewUser -> NewUser: 使用新帳號登入系統
note left
  下一步:
  使用者可以用
  註冊的 Email 和密碼
  登入系統
  
  參考: 使用案例 7.2 (使用者登入)
end note

@enduml